{
  "description": "2D real-time arena skirmish: thin organism composing headless std mechanic atoms (grid-tactics unit authority, fx-particles, round-flow, score, anim-tick) on one [runtime, shared] GameState with a single canvas-2d render authority. A 2-second clock drives the raider chase; the player commands a two-marine fireteam — select, move, focus-fire — around impassable crate debris. Down both raiders to win; lose both marines and the arena falls.",
